OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver dropped knife during
OL,4,Adrunken dance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who dropped a knife while dancing
OL,7,Fdrunkenly out of a bar in
OL,8,FNottinghamshire has been sentenced.
OL,10,FMihai Cazacu, 38, was leaving The Duck
OL,11,Fin Castle Gate, Newark, at about 20:30
OL,12,FBST on 15 August after drinking beer
OL,13,Fand vodka, police said.
OL,15,FAs he danced towards the exit, CCTV
OL,16,Finside the bar filmed a knife falling
OL,17,Ffrom his back pocket which was
OL,18,Fretrieved by a member of staff.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
