OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver dropped knife during
OL,4,Adrunken dance
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoor staff detained Cazacu, of no fixed
OL,7,Fabode, as he tried to leave before
OL,8,Fpolice arrived. At Nottingham
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on 17 August, he was
OL,10,Ffined and handed a suspended jail term.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
